& [Fold_1_Identity] defines canonical Draft 2020-12 schema and bundle identities
& [Fold_2_Forms] extracts one public transport-neutral definition for prepare, run, verify, response, fault, and verification records
& [Fold_3_Derivation] generates schemas from the shared types and normalizes every object key and definition deterministically
& [Fold_4_Residuals] enumerates every cross-field, graph, digest, policy, replay, and authority rule left to core validation
& [Fold_5_Conformance] compares schema and serde behavior over positive, boundary, malformed, unknown, and adversarial values
& [Fold_6_Projection] derives provider-neutral tool definitions and records provider-subset loss without altering canonical meaning
& [Fold_7_Evolution] fingerprints types, classifies compatibility, binds source revision, and fails release on unexplained drift

& [Pruning] removes premature implementation
  + no live MCP procedure server
